                <note rend="inline" type="source">352.115/115: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul General at Barcelona</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Perkins</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-10-10T14:00:00-05:00">October 10, 1936—2
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your October 8, 8 p.m., and October 9, noon. Your action heartily approved.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
